  "description": "VOLCANO HYBRID ALSO IN STOCK\n\nONYX Edition: Fearless, bold and daring.\n\nThe new limited VOLCANO ONYX edition is an absolute eye-catcher. The ONYX color is reminiscent of black lava rock, which perfectly matches the VOLCANO’s iconic shape. The high-quality powder coating makes the cone even more scratch-resistant, and the matte black makes for a strong appearance of extravagance. There’s no question that the proven long-lasting quality from STORZ & BICKEL continues with this limited ONYX edition.\n\nFeatures:\nVolcano Classic Onyx\nManual Temperature Control\nTemp range of 130C to 226C\nForced Air Vaporizer\nRemovable Filter\n110V AC Adapter\n3 Year Manufacturer Warranty\nUnit Weight: 2.6 lb / 1.2 kg\nUnit Dimensions: 7″H * 8″L * 8″W\nShipping Box Dimensions: 9.75″H * 10″L * 10″W\n\nEasy Valve Set Includes:\n4* Easy Valve Balloons (pre-made)\n1* Easy Valve Balloon with Adapter\nFilling Chamber with Cap\nLiquid Pad\nNormal Screen Set\nCleaning Brush\n\nAccessory Package (extra $15)\n1 Solid valve box of bags\n1 Normal Screen Set\n2 Cleaning Sticks\n1 Cleaning Brush\n\nSolid Valve Kit Available\nOnly $97.49, click here\n\nVolcano Classic Warranty Information\nVisit the manufacturer website for warranty information\nhttps://www.storz-bickel.com/shop_us/en/support/",
